sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as AI application
    participant O as Agent/workflow orchestrator
    participant P as Policy enforcement
    participant C as Context retrieval
    participant M as Model gateway
    participant T as Enterprise tool
    actor H as Human approver
    participant L as Audit and observability

    U->>A: Submit request
    A->>P: Authenticate session and authorize use case
    P-->>A: Identity, purpose, and allowed scope
    A->>L: Record authenticated request
    A->>O: Start workflow with identity and correlation ID
    O->>P: Authorize retrieval request
    P-->>O: Permitted sources and filters
    O->>C: Retrieve authorized context
    C->>L: Record query, source versions, and access decision
    C-->>O: Evidence with provenance and freshness
    O->>P: Validate model, data class, and routing policy
    P-->>O: Approved model constraints
    O->>M: Invoke model with minimized context
    M->>L: Record model, prompt version, usage, and latency
    M-->>O: Response or proposed tool action

    opt Model proposes a tool action
        O->>P: Validate tool, parameters, limits, and user authority
        P-->>O: Permit, deny, or require approval
        alt High-impact action requires human approval
            O->>H: Present proposed action, evidence, and policy result
            H->>L: Record approval decision and rationale
            H-->>O: Approve or reject
        end
        alt Action is permitted and approved when required
            O->>T: Execute typed action with idempotency key
            T->>P: Reauthorize at system boundary
            P-->>T: Permit execution
            T->>L: Record authoritative action result
            T-->>O: Tool result
        else Action is denied or rejected
            O->>L: Record denied action and workflow outcome
        end
    end

    O->>L: Record final workflow state and linked evidence
    O-->>A: Final response with evidence and action status
    A-->>U: Present response, limitations, and next step
    A->>L: Record delivery and user-visible outcome
